    structure: hollow rectangle with variable border thickness (1-4 per side)
    bbox: 5-12 rows x 5-19 cols
    interior: 3-10 rows x 3-15 cols, contains only bg and grey markers
    placement: bboxes never overlap; 1-3 may touch grid border [observed]
