  objects:
    count: 1-4 solid 3x3 rectangles (all 9 cells non-background)
    colors: each object uses exactly 2 distinct non-background colors
    color_split: minority 2-4 cells, majority 5-7 cells (observed splits (4,5), (3,6), (2,7))
    color_sharing: colors may be reused across objects [observed]
